## What it is

A story-driven, open-world role-playing game set in the futuristic streets of Night City.

## Is this your kind of game?

Consider this if character development and a story set in a futuristic city are what you want from an evening of play. Watch an ordinary gameplay sequence to see the balance between conversations, travel, and combat.

## Download and purchase

This is a paid game. Check the official store for current regional pricing, editions, and purchase terms. Use the official Steam button on this page to open the publisher's listing. Installation is handled by Steam; GameNews does not host installers or game files.

Compare the base game and any expansion or bundle carefully. Use the requirements for the content you actually intend to buy rather than an old release-day specification.

## Before installing

Compare your operating system, processor, memory, graphics support, and available storage with the complete current requirements. A minimum specification is not a promise of a particular frame rate on your computer. Leave room for updates and check any additional account requirements before downloading.

## Sources and editorial basis

Product information checked against the [official Steam listing](https://store.steampowered.com/app/1091500/?l=english) on 16 October 2026. Selected with reference to [Steam's most-played chart](https://store.steampowered.com/charts/mostplayed/). This is a researched profile, not a hands-on review or a search-volume ranking. Live prices, player counts, and performance scores are intentionally not quoted.
